    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tete\u2019s Atelier</strong> is a Cozy Game where you transform <strong>shirts, jackets, eco bags, pants, sweaters, and more</strong> into personalized pieces. After customizing your clothes with <strong>patches, shapes, and colors</strong>, a special machine animation visually finalizes the process, highlighting the finishing touch. Then, you can sell your creations in your in-game store. Customers place bids on customizations, and each sale helps expand your creativity and collection in the atelier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How Does the Gameplay Work?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc55<strong>Choose the Clothing/Accessory</strong> \u2013 Browse the menu and select a clothing or accessory model you want to transform.\u00a0\ud83c\udfa8Use the color palette to add more style and personality to your clothes and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484990/extras/1db3eabd00eeb7ca201fb397d8afe9b6.poster.avif?t=1741009416\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484990/extras/1db3eabd00eeb7ca201fb397d8afe9b6.webm?t=1741009416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484990/extras/1db3eabd00eeb7ca201fb397d8afe9b6.mp4?t=1741009416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd0<strong>Apply Shapes</strong> \u2013 Choose from various decorative shapes and place them\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >freely to create a unique and sophisticated design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484990/extras/ed28668acc801bcfb831db518a50ff19.poster.avif?t=1741009416\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484990/extras/ed28668acc801bcfb831db518a50ff19.webm?t=1741009416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484990/extras/ed28668acc801bcfb831db518a50ff19.mp4?t=1741009416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3c<strong>Apply Patches</strong> \u2013 Select from dozens of exclusive patches and position them on your chosen piece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484990/extras/0d0ea0763fd68bdbc27dcdc22894b8bd.poster.avif?t=1741009416\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484990/extras/0d0ea0763fd68bdbc27dcdc22894b8bd.webm?t=1741009416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484990/extras/0d0ea0763fd68bdbc27dcdc22894b8bd.mp4?t=1741009416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfec<strong>Sell in Your Store</strong> \u2013 Each piece receives bids from customers in the game. You can <strong>accept</strong> the best offer by clicking on the request or simply <strong>decline</strong> by leaving the store. Sometimes, there may be no bids available, encouraging you to explore new customizations.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484990/extras/700f3b99f50c6deeef41690291d67213.poster.avif?t=1741009416\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484990/extras/700f3b99f50c6deeef41690291d67213.webm?t=1741009416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484990/extras/700f3b99f50c6deeef41690291d67213.mp4?t=1741009416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2<strong>Earn Money and Expand</strong> \u2013 Use sales profits to purchase <strong>new patches, shapes, and clothes</strong>, allowing even more possibilities to express your creativity.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484990/extras/c2be5d6f38c940b3663b7ed2f9c6f8f0.poster.avif?t=1741009416\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484990/extras/c2be5d6f38c940b3663b7ed2f9c6f8f0.webm?t=1741009416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484990/extras/c2be5d6f38c940b3663b7ed2f9c6f8f0.mp4?t=1741009416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f\u2728 <strong>Transform Your Clothes into True Works of Art!</strong> \u2728\ud83c\udf3f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our <strong>charming atelier</strong>, you\u2019ll have access to a world of possibilities to personalize each piece with love and creativity.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>50+ Exclusive Patches</strong> \u2013 Unique embroidery to style up your clothes! <br>\u2702\ufe0f <strong>50+ Decorative Shapes</strong> \u2013 Add a special and personalized touch to your designs. <br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>30+ Vibrant and Soft Colors</strong> \u2013 Paint your clothes and shapes with love and creativity. <br>\ud83c\udfe1 <strong>Customization Gallery</strong> \u2013 Review and admire all your creations anytime. <br>\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Virtual Store</strong> \u2013 Sell personalized pieces to customers who make unique offers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With relaxing mechanics and a <strong>hand-drawn art style</strong>, <strong>Tete\u2019s Atelier: Patches</strong> offers a <strong>cozy, creative, and charming experience</strong>, turning every clothing piece into a true work of art!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tete\u2019s Atelier</strong> is a Cozy Game where you transform <strong>shirts, jackets, eco bags, pants, sweaters, and more</strong> into personalized pieces. After customizing your clothes with <strong>patches, shapes, and colors</strong>, a special machine animation visually finalizes the process, highlighting the finishing touch. Then, you can sell your creations in your in-game store. Customers place bids on customizations, and each sale helps expand your creativity and collection in the atelier.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How Does the Gameplay Work?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc55<strong>Choose the Clothing/Accessory</strong> \u2013 Browse the menu and select a clothing or accessory model you want to transform.\u00a0\ud83c\udfa8Use the color palette to add more style and personality to your clothes and accessories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484990/extras/1db3eabd00eeb7ca201fb397d8afe9b6.poster.avif?t=1741009416\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484990/extras/1db3eabd00eeb7ca201fb397d8afe9b6.webm?t=1741009416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484990/extras/1db3eabd00eeb7ca201fb397d8afe9b6.mp4?t=1741009416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd0<strong>Apply Shapes</strong> \u2013 Choose from various decorative shapes and place them\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >freely to create a unique and sophisticated design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steams